<title>UK: London silver fixes touch firmer at 476.00 cents.</title>
<headline>London silver fixes touch firmer at 476.00 cents.</headline>
<text>
<p>SILVER - Fixed at 476.00 cents vs 474.75 cents. Mildly firmer behind PGMs but quiet and attracting little interest.</p>
<p>GOLD - Watching for any Bundesbank council meeting comments on gold revaluation. Quiet $344.80/$345.10, up 80 cents.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Up on Rustenburg strike news. $403.75/$404.75, up</p>
<p>$7.25. PALLADIUM - $183.00/$185.00, about $6.25 ahead.</p>
</text>
